{
  "slug": "blue-collar-governance",
  "name": "Blue Collar Governance",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Deterministic AI governance runtime for Claude Code. 22 JavaScript engines compute governance decisions before the AI agent sees them — no LLM involvement in governance logic. 19 lifecycle event handlers covering prompt intake, tool execution, subagent verification, compaction integrity, config protection, and session teardown. Includes post-session verification (Foreman's Walk), append-only forensic evidence chain, three-tier autonomy control (FULL_AUTO / SUPERVISED / HARD_STOP), and operator-facing skills for governance visibility. 388 golden tests. Zero external dependencies. Fail-closed architecture: exit code 2 blocks, not prompts. Built for operators who need governance they can trust, not governance they have to hope Claude follows.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **35 skills** and **24 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (35): `as-built` (Render SessionReceipt summarizeAsBuilt output as deterministic accountability delta with no writes), `buddy-status` (Render a read-only watcher snapshot from current policy and active callouts already recorded), `callout` (Render a read-only callout-detail snapshot from current Buddy callouts already recorded), `census` (Render a manual local repo snapshot from explicit observable truth), `chain` (Render existing ForensicChain entry history as a deterministic read/query/render-only view), `change-order` (Render a read-only snapshot of existing change orders and their current recorded decision status), `confidence` (Render a read-only confidence-marker map plus optional required coverage, optional marker continuity, and optional explicit dated temporal signals…), `confidence-transitions` (Preview and explicitly append neutral confidence transition findings from explicit marker continuity compare input), and 27 more\n- **Hooks** (24): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreCompact`, `PostCompact`, `PreToolUse`, `PermissionRequest`, `PermissionDenied`, `PostToolUse`, and 16 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install blue-collar-governance@claude-community` from `TDE6541/blue-collar-governance-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 35,
    "hook": 24
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
